      "html": "Flat universes with one component: the age follows from $a\\propto t^{2/(3(1+w))}$ and $H=\\dot a/a$."
     },
     {
      "kind": "eq",
      "tex": "\\text{matter: }t_0=\\frac2{3H_0},\\qquad \\text{radiation: }t=\\frac1{2H},\\qquad \\text{empty (Milne): }t_0=\\frac1{H_0}",
      "label": "age of flat one-component universes"
     },
